{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"只写亲近带来的舒服、心思飘远和不急于前往，没有把亲密交谈后的安静具体化成真实场景，也没有明确把音乐变化当成心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"盼望亲近长久、意识到对方是否同样珍惜不由自己决定，都是心理事实，没有新增具体人物关系、外部事件或场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"写的是偶尔想知道自己是否特别以及尚未打算索取答复，没有把珠子中念头想说话的比喻落实成实际对白或行动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-4\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"把念头出现后的不自在和思绪受阻写成心理反应，原因指向他开始在意的问题，而不是音乐本身的变化。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-2已经写出他不靠追问回应来维持亲近、仍能安心关心对方，足以支撑S03-1延续的舒服感。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-3写明他曾觉得眼下的安静亲近已经足够，给出了后来开始盼望这份亲近长久的满足感基础。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-4已经写到他因时间流逝而盼这一刻慢些、尚未失去便开始舍不得，直接支持他盼望亲近长久。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-4\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-3提供了先前觉得亲近已足够的安稳基线，却不能单独解释新念头为何冒出，更直接的触发内容来自S03-3。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"从享受亲近到盼望长久、开始在意自己是否特别，再到原有的自在受到影响，心理推进清楚，读者不看珠子也能理解这一段的变化。\",\n  \"lost\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R11\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"R11中“自己能决定怎样珍惜对方”这一当下明确意识到的主动性没有完整保留，修补后只写了对方是否同样珍惜不由自己决定；S02-2虽已写他能安心关心对方，但那更像行为状态，没有完全替代此处对双方可控性的明确对照。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S03-3\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"“还没打算要答复”搭配生硬，与“偶尔想知道”之间的区别也没有说顺，读起来有些拧；它想表达的是尚未打算索取答复，而不是不想知道答案。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8eff7e95-1c03-402a-86bc-ae7dbb4633f4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T100213435795Z", "elapsed_seconds": 510.718, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T10:10:44.154568+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "26eb24be1f3a8e71fba3effe0fc84206c5095335f427bc3e9cf67e16229a77aa", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T100213435795Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "3792f456d8a86c3c4ffa3a398b15d43f9962509b70f65457c257b69758fddaf8"}}}
